<title>FRANCE: IBCA gives AA note to UAP Provincial Insurance Plc.</title>
<headline>IBCA gives AA note to UAP Provincial Insurance Plc.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA said it had given a AA note to UAP Provincial Insurance Plc and said its portfolio was well balanced.</p>
</text>
